  "plan": "I'll write a Python script that uses the e2b SDK to: 1) Create a new sandbox, 2) Create a file /home/user/checkpoint.txt with content 'checkpoint 1', 3) Create a snapshot, 4) Write the snapshot ID to /home/user/output.txt on the local machine. Let me first check the e2b module to understand its API.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "python3 -c \"import e2b; print(dir(e2b))\" 2>&1\n",
      "duration": 0.5
